  "text": "Hello Sarah, John and Priya — I'd like to hold next week's CSE455 staff meeting. The slots that are free on my calendar are:\n\n- Monday 10:00-10:30\n- Tuesday 15:00-15:30\n- Wednesday 13:00-13:30\n\nPlease tell me which one works for you (or propose another time inside 09:00-17:00). Once we all agree I'll book it and confirm.",
