  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez — thanks. For me both of these work:\n\n- Tuesday 15:00-15:30 — free\n- Wednesday 13:00-13:30 — free\n\nMonday 10:00-10:30 I can't: I have CSE455 office hours until 10:30.\n\nOf the two, Wednesday 13:00-13:30 suits me slightly better, but either is fine — take whichever works for Sarah and Priya too. Once you book it I'll put it on my calendar.\n\n— John",
