  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez, John, Priya — all three of those slots are free on my calendar:\n\n- Monday 10:00-10:30 — free (after the reading group, before my CSE452 lab focus)\n- Tuesday 15:00-15:30 — free (after the CSE452 lecture, before CSE455 office hours)\n- Wednesday 13:00-13:30 — free (after lunch, before the CSE455 quiz section)\n\nSo any of them works for me. If it helps to pick, I'd slightly prefer Wednesday 13:00-13:30 or Monday 10:00-10:30, but I can make Tuesday work too. Once you and the others agree, I'll put it in my calendar as soon as you confirm the booking.",
